#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- Use the [`Neat` class](/guides/debug-qiskit-runtime-jobs) to analyze the noise impact on an Estimator workload.\n"
"- Review detailed [Sampler examples](/guides/sampler-examples).\n"
"- Review detailed [Estimator examples](/guides/estimator-examples).\n"
"- Read [Migrate to V2 primitives](/guides/v2-primitives).\n"
"- Practice with primitives by working through the [Cost function lesson](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) in IBM Quantum Learning.\n"
"- Learn how to transpile locally in the [Transpile](/guides/transpile) section.\n"
"- Try the [Compare transpiler settings](/guides/circuit-transpilation-settings#compare-transpiler-settings) tutorial.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Empfehlungen\">\n"
"- Verwende die [`Neat`-Klasse](/guides/debug-qiskit-runtime-jobs), um den Rauscheinfluss auf eine Estimator-Arbeitslast zu analysieren.\n"
"- Sieh dir detaillierte [Sampler-Beispiele](/guides/sampler-examples) an.\n"
"- Sieh dir detaillierte [Estimator-Beispiele](/guides/estimator-examples) an.\n"
"- Lies [Zu V2 Primitives migrieren](/guides/v2-primitives).\n"
"- Übe mit Primitives, indem du die [Kostenfunktions-Lektion](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) in IBM Quantum Learning durcharbeitest.\n"
"- Lerne, wie du lokal transpilierst, im Abschnitt [Transpile](/guides/transpile).\n"
"- Probiere das Tutorial [Transpiler-Einstellungen vergleichen](/guides/circuit-transpilation-settings#compare-transpiler-settings) aus.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
